ure of the sarcomere matrix of skeletal muscle: immunoelectron microscopic evidence that suggests a set of parallel inextensible nebulin filaments anchored at the Z line. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>107</volume>:<fpage>2199</fpage>&#x02013;2212.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3058720</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>